      "finding": "RAFT trains on questions with oracle and distractor documents, sometimes omitting the oracle, and reports comparisons against fine-tuning and RAG baselines across five datasets.",
      "support": ["E11", "E12", "E13"],
      "counterevidence": [],
      "unknown": "Full implementation details are not established by the inspected pages."
    },
    {
      "check_id": "C2",
      "status": "mixed",
      "finding": "Reported results are strong on several benchmarks but vary by dataset; the CoT ablation favors CoT on four listed datasets and disfavors it on Torch Hub. The inspected material does not isolate verbatim citation’s effect.",
      "support": ["E13", "E15"],
      "counterevidence": ["E13", "E15"],
      "unknown": "Pages 8–11 were not inspected, and no separate citation ablation is established in the inspected material."
    },
    {
      "check_id": "C3",
      "status": "unknown",
      "finding": "The observed pages specify a domain-specific open-book scope and include analyses of oracle proportions and distractors, but later discussion and limitations remain uninspected.",
      "support": ["E10", "E14"],
      "counterevidence": [],
      "unknown": "Pages 8–11 were not inspected, so their discussion, limitations, and additional experiments are unknown."
    }
  ],
  "changes": "Replaced the unverified quotation with a verbatim excerpt from page 3. Corrected the CoT comparison: RAFT with CoT scores below the no-CoT ablation on Torch Hub, not the other way around. Kept the score and scope uncertainty; later pages were not available for inspection."
}

